# GBackgroundAI — optional development secrets
#
# IMPORTANT: this app is a pure client-side SPA (plus an optional local Python
# proxy). Vite only exposes variables prefixed with VITE_ to browser code, so a
# bare GEMINI_API_KEY would never reach the app. Any value set here is baked into
# the JS bundle at build time — NEVER put a production/real-money key in here.
# Normal users paste keys in Settings → Providers, and they stay in the
# device's localStorage only.
#
# Read at boot by src/App.tsx to hydrate the matching built-in provider when no
# key has been saved yet (dev convenience, lowest priority).
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=""
VITE_NVIDIA_API_KEY=""
VITE_GROQ_API_KEY=""

# Optional local CORS proxy (backend/main.py, FastAPI). The frontend calls the
# providers directly; run this only when a provider refuses browser requests:
#   cd backend && pip install -r requirements.txt && uvicorn main:app --port 8000
# Then use http://localhost:8000/... as the provider base URL where relevant.
PROXY_ORIGIN="http://localhost:8000"
